{"src":"de","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":214500,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"de","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":8583.408750999999,"text":"Im Jahr 1990 wurde es aufgrund der Bedrohung durch Wüstensand zur Liste der gefährdeten Weltkulturerbegebiete hinzugefügt."},{"kind":"text","t":9025.904891999999,"text":"In 1990, it was added to the List of World Heritage in Danger due to the threat of desert sand."},{"kind":"audio","t":9087.858193999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9089.395585,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9091.000188,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9092.552678999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9094.159021,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9095.048729,"samples":21560,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":320},{"kind":"input","t":14622.338565,"text":"Wenn Sie den Film Das Vermächtnis der Tempelritter gesehen haben,"},{"kind":"text","t":14891.547962,"text":"If you have seen the film The Legacy of the Knights Templar,"},{"kind":"audio","t":14946.663016999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14947.911101999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14949.260428999998,"samples":30464,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":670},{"kind":"input","t":20983.480417,"text":"Denken Sie vielleicht, dass auf der Rückseite der Unabhängigkeitserklärung eine Schatzkarte gezeichnet wurde."},{"kind":"text","t":21315.79169,"text":"you might think that a treasure map was drawn on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"audio","t":21371.402084999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21373.100139,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21374.619888999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21376.180011,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":21376.352474,"samples":12328,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":33766.665029,"text":"Kinder werden aus einer Vielzahl von Gründen in Pflegefamilien untergebracht, und zwar aus verschiedenen Gründen, die von Vernachlässigung über Missbrauch bis hin zur Erpressung reichen."},{"kind":"text","t":34134.490503,"text":"Children are placed in foster care for a variety of reasons, ranging from neglect and abuse to blackmail."},{"kind":"audio","t":34190.669389,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":34192.796242000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34194.116499,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":34195.725601000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":300,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34197.804993000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34198.65383,"samples":22760,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":320},{"kind":"input","t":44833.269265,"text":"Das Cochamo-Tal Chiles wichtigstes Kletterziel, bekannt als der Josemite National Park von Südamerika mit einer Vielzahl von großen Granitwänden und Klippen."},{"kind":"text","t":45381.557978000004,"text":"Chile's Cochamo Valley is its premier climbing destination, known as the Yosemite National Park of South America with a variety of massive granite walls and cliffs."},{"kind":"audio","t":45446.239105,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45447.920369,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45449.617493000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45451.114863,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45452.811427,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45454.409039000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1120},{"kind":"audio","t":45456.001721,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45457.913939000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45459.170114,"samples":29456,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":640},{"kind":"input","t":51548.041721,"text":"Aristoteles' Ansichten zu allen Wissenschaftsfragen einschließlich der Psychologie waren anerkannt."},{"kind":"text","t":51859.493386,"text":"Aristotle's views on all scientific questions, including psychology, were recognized."},{"kind":"audio","t":51914.686932000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51916.100751000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51917.756204000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51919.401187,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51920.716653,"samples":29128,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":670},{"kind":"input","t":62215.052444,"text":"Wenn Sie es nicht gewohnt sind, auf Landstraßen zu fahren, bleiben Sie achtsam. Steiles Gefälle, enge Fahrbahnen und scharfe Kurven überwiegen hier."},{"kind":"text","t":62494.779043,"text":"If you are not used to driving on country roads, stay alert. Steep gradients, narrow roads, and sharp bends predominate here."},{"kind":"audio","t":62549.280395,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62551.00884,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62552.624812,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":62552.826006,"samples":10296,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":62587.641085,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":360,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":62589.160735000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62590.793458,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62591.439831,"samples":18696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":200},{"kind":"input","t":73269.389012,"text":"Die Gegenwart eines echten, unsichtbaren Teams, Larsson und Lafasto, 1989, Seite 109."},{"kind":"text","t":73754.424376,"text":"The presence of a real, invisible team, Larsson and Lafasto, 1989, page 109."},{"kind":"audio","t":73812.291616,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73813.9435,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":73815.420239,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":340,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73817.029751,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73818.660714,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73819.896369,"samples":29360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":590},{"kind":"input","t":77718.879481,"text":"ist auch ein einzigartiger Bestandteil eines virtuellen Teams."},{"kind":"text","t":77926.286159,"text":"is also a unique component of a virtual team."},{"kind":"audio","t":77977.48654499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77978.94200499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77980.13653799999,"samples":28064,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":540},{"kind":"input","t":87197.795414,"text":"Nach dem Unfall wurde Gibson in ein Krankenhaus gebracht."},{"kind":"text","t":87418.63267199999,"text":"After the accident, Gibson was taken to a hospital."},{"kind":"audio","t":87470.29321799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":87471.838559,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":340,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87473.45576099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":890},{"kind":"audio","t":87473.553373,"samples":2496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":91090.85334799999,"text":"Er verstarb jedoch kurz darauf."},{"kind":"text","t":91255.245784,"text":"However, he passed away shortly thereafter."},{"kind":"audio","t":91305.234336,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91306.76942699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91307.286517,"samples":17264,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":110},{"kind":"input","t":96643.35487099999,"text":"Viele deutsche Backwaren beinhalten außerdem Mandeln, Haselnüsse oder andere Nüsse."},{"kind":"text","t":96903.90620499999,"text":"Many German baked goods also contain almonds, hazelnuts, or other nuts."},{"kind":"audio","t":96957.747865,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":96959.38302699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":96961.00138,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":96962.685694,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":96962.793286,"samples":3928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":101424.364707,"text":"Beliebte Kuchen passen häufig besonders gut zu einer Tasse starken Kaffees."},{"kind":"text","t":101677.24268699999,"text":"Popular cakes often go particularly well with a cup of strong coffee."},{"kind":"audio","t":101732.856382,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":101734.32781199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":150,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101735.889883,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101737.343102,"samples":31896,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":720},{"kind":"input","t":107133.114003,"text":"Wenn man eine romanische Sprache spricht, ist es natürlich leichter, Portugiesisch zu erlernen."},{"kind":"text","t":107419.371162,"text":"If you speak a Romance language, it is naturally easier to learn Portuguese."},{"kind":"audio","t":107473.370065,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":107474.956587,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":107476.668261,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":107478.555609,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":990},{"kind":"audio","t":107478.66230099999,"samples":4528,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":116070.10109,"text":"Die Klang- und Lichtshow bei den Pyramiden ist eine der interessantesten Attraktionen für Kinder in der Gegend."},{"kind":"text","t":116449.83411299999,"text":"The sound and light show at the pyramids is one of the most interesting attractions for children in the area."},{"kind":"audio","t":116506.243404,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116507.79876599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116509.310096,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116511.00641,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":116512.636023,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":116512.855247,"samples":11960,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":126823.986305,"text":"Verkehrsfluss ist die Untersuchung der Bewegung einzelner Fahrer und Fahrzeuge zwischen zwei Punkten und der Interaktionen, die zwischen beiden stattfinden."},{"kind":"text","t":127273.601,"text":"Traffic flow is the study of the movement of individual drivers and vehicles between two points and the interactions that take place between them."},{"kind":"audio","t":127336.75040599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":127338.37479799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127339.994521,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127341.620243,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127343.202815,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1040},{"kind":"audio","t":127344.851148,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":110,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127346.47210099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1180},{"kind":"audio","t":127346.704445,"samples":10624,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":137839.17410099998,"text":"Der Australier Mitchell Gurley wurde 11. im stehenden Super-G der Männer. Der tschechische Konkurrent Aldrich Jelinek wurde 16. im sitzenden Super-G der Männer."},{"kind":"text","t":138142.61803399998,"text":"The Australian Mitchell Gurley finished 11th. in the men's standing Super-G. The Czech competitor Aldrich Jelinek finished 16th. in the men's sitting Super-G."},{"kind":"audio","t":138194.436223,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138195.97760399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138196.848562,"samples":22064,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":350},{"kind":"audio","t":138238.713251,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138240.348714,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":138242.036608,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138243.705621,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":138244.20806099998,"samples":16528,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":138279.289465,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138280.259344,"samples":27232,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":590},{"kind":"input","t":148924.042155,"text":"Das Haitianische Institut für Gerechtigkeit und Demokratie hat auf unabhängigen Studien verwiesen, die nahelegen, dass das nepalesische UN-Friedensbataillon die Krankheit unwissentlich"},{"kind":"text","t":149353.698839,"text":"The Haitian Institute for Justice and Democracy has pointed to independent studies suggesting that the Nepalese UN peace-keeping battalion unwittingly"},{"kind":"audio","t":149413.558339,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149415.05460899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149416.573619,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149418.223753,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":149419.830045,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":350,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":149421.503018,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":120,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149423.130621,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149424.776954,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":890},{"kind":"audio","t":149424.890746,"samples":3056,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":151484.02551,"text":"nach Haiti eingeschleppt hat."},{"kind":"text","t":151604.364183,"text":"introduced to Haiti."},{"kind":"audio","t":151653.91799699998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":151654.309495,"samples":18832,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":240},{"kind":"input","t":158639.97167199999,"text":"Bald nach dem Ausbruch von Kampfhandlungen initiierte Großbritannien eine Seeblockade gegen Deutschland."},{"kind":"text","t":158940.193011,"text":"Shortly after the outbreak of hostilities, Great Britain initiated a naval blockade against Germany."},{"kind":"audio","t":158995.596292,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158997.072352,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158998.62071299998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":470,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159000.284716,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159001.916849,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":159002.324497,"samples":13760,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":167072.21889,"text":"Er griff auch alles an, was ins Wasser kam. Selbst ein großer Dinosaurier wie der T-Rex war ihm nicht gewachsen."},{"kind":"text","t":167360.53962999998,"text":"He also attacked everything that came his way. Even a large dinosaur like the T-Rex was no match for him."},{"kind":"audio","t":167413.655255,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":167415.153635,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167415.674736,"samples":16664,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":90},{"kind":"audio","t":167452.041645,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167453.76871899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":167455.339821,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167455.853411,"samples":16296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":90},{"kind":"input","t":179060.375522,"text":"Die Verwendung von Videoaufzeichnungen führte zu wichtigen Erkenntnissen für die Deutung von Mikroexpressionen, wenige Millisekunden dauernden Gesichtsbewegungen."},{"kind":"text","t":179494.15559799998,"text":"The use of video recordings led to important insights for the interpretation of microexpressions, facial movements lasting only a few milliseconds."},{"kind":"audio","t":179555.05082899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179556.768104,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179558.289294,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1180},{"kind":"audio","t":179560.00847899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179561.607621,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1140},{"kind":"audio","t":179563.303375,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179564.81273499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179566.406377,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":800},{"kind":"audio","t":179566.54447999998,"samples":656,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":188379.030532,"text":"Die Ankündigung erfolgte nach einem Telefongespräch von Trump mit dem türkischen Präsidenten Recep Tayyip."},{"kind":"text","t":188650.952784,"text":"The announcement followed a phone call between Trump and Turkish President Recep Tayyip."},{"kind":"audio","t":188707.09404999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":188708.76656299998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":188710.346705,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":188711.98761799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1110},{"kind":"audio","t":188712.138101,"samples":9928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":199700.450379,"text":"Es gibt Familienstrände, die manchmal überlaufen sind, mit einer schönen Einkaufspromenade entlang der Küste, das Schwimmen ist hier sicher."},{"kind":"text","t":200118.80075599998,"text":"There are family beaches that are sometimes crowded, with a lovely shopping promenade along the coast; swimming is safe here."},{"kind":"audio","t":200174.683596,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200176.153166,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200177.737708,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200179.421971,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200181.111505,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":870},{"kind":"audio","t":200181.23034799998,"samples":1760,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":200211.75056,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200212.309851,"samples":17032,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":180},{"kind":"input","t":212313.558191,"text":"Die meisten der kleineren Inseln sind unabhängige Nationen oder zu Frankreich gehörig und als luxuriöse Seebäder."},{"kind":"text","t":212669.56158799998,"text":"Most of the smaller islands are independent nations or belong to France and serve as luxurious seaside resorts."},{"kind":"audio","t":212728.854027,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":212730.49477,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":212732.084692,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":212733.679613,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":212735.254385,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":212736.913818,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1120},{"kind":"audio","t":212737.043061,"samples":7392,"rate":24000},{"kind":"close","t":224604.540793,"code":1005}]}